story_text.value:
Hi HN,<p>I’ve just launched Rezon8AI, an <em>AI</em>-powered reputation management platform built specifically for small and medium-sized service businesses—like local trades, clinics, <em>agencies</em>, gyms, and growing franchises.<p>In a world where one bad review can scare off potential customers, service businesses struggle to keep up. Juggling Google, Yelp, Tripadvisor, Trustpilot, Facebook, and more—with no dedicated marketing team—is overwhelming.<p>Rezon8AI helps take that weight off.<p>What it does:<p>- <em>AI</em>-Powered Feedback Funnel: Trained on your business and your specific service offerings, our system intelligently routes happy customers to public review sites and captures unhappy feedback privately—before it goes public.<p>- Customer Sentiment Insights: Quickly spot trends in customer satisfaction and areas for improvement, without reading every comment.<p>- Automated Review Requests: Send via email, SMS, or display a QR code at point-of-service—simple, unobtrusive, and effective.<p>- Easy Setup: Designed for non-tech users. No coding. Runs from any web-capable device.<p>Why I built it: Most tools passively monitor reviews. That’s too late. I built Rezon8AI to help businesses proactively shape their reputation—while keeping control over how feedback is handled and showcased.<p>I've launched it with a free trial and would love feedback from the HN community—especially around UX, messaging, integrations, and roadmap ideas.<p>Thanks,
Grant - &quot;the Rezon8AI team&quot;
(30+ years solving SME challenges through tech and <em>automation</em>)

